        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">Revision: 19 October 2026, coherence with the 19 October calculations and CAD model (T016): D-049 exports, D-051 cap reports and D-054 pile reports recorded as current; end-bent design record refreshed; MSE exclusion wall lines re-extracted from the D-055 model; notebook check retargeted to build e9b41b8eaf.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">Revision: 8 October 2026, coherence responses. End-bent input uses loaded nodes 15 and 34, 103-in bearing spacing and a 42-in-wide by 36-in-deep cap. Both end bents follow the controlling configuration. End-bent pedestals are 30 in long; pier pedestals remain 48 in. Deferred wall quantities and remaining design checks are identified in the current record.</paragraph>
